#! files=10000 dirs=0
# Tier B: opening a folder of ten thousand files, then the three navigations that re-list it.
#
# `time` runs the verb it wraps exactly as the verb runs on its own — `go` awaits the navigation and
# then Settle waits out the listing and the metadata hydration — so each sample is "issued to quiet".

bench-fixture 10000 0 Flat
time list go Flat
assert-count 10000
time refresh refresh
time up up
time back back
assert-count 10000
mem listing
assert-not-launched
